<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><x:worksheet xmlns:x="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/spreadsheetml/2006/main"><x:sheetFormatPr defaultRowHeight="15" /><x:cols><x:col min="1" max="1" width="34" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="2" max="2" width="22" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="3" max="3" width="18" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="4" max="4" width="54" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="5" max="5" width="36" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="6" max="6" width="52" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /></x:cols><x:sheetData><x:row r="1" ht="26" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A1" s="284" t="str"><x:v>07 — TRAY TYPE / RUNG-SPACING DECISION</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B1" s="284" /><x:c r="C1" s="284" /><x:c r="D1" s="284" /><x:c r="E1" s="284" /><x:c r="F1" s="284" /></x:row><x:row r="2" ht="30" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A2" s="289" /><x:c r="B2" s="289" /><x:c r="C2" s="289" /><x:c r="D2" s="289" /><x:c r="E2" s="289" /><x:c r="F2" s="289" /></x:row><x:row r="3" ht="28" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Metric</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Value</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Status</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Decision Basis</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Source</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F3" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Engineering Note</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="4"><x:c r="A4" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Included circuits</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B4" s="308" t="n"><x:f>COUNTIF('CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes")</x:f><x:v>8</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C4" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(B4=0,"INPUT REQUIRED","INFO")</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D4" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Count of included circuits.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E4" s="308" t="str"><x:v>CABLE_ENGINE</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F4" s="308" t="str" /></x:row><x:row r="5"><x:c r="A5" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Power physical cables</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B5" s="308" t="n"><x:f>SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Power")</x:f><x:v>9</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C5" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Any power cable drives the default industrial/commercial ladder path.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Ladder is the most widely used industrial/commercial tray and maximizes airflow.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="6"><x:c r="A6" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Control + instrumentation physical cables</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B6" s="308" t="n"><x:f>SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Control")+SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Instrumentation")</x:f><x:v>0</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C6" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Small control/instrument populations support closer rung/channel options.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>6/9/12-in rung spacings are recommended for small control/instrument cable.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="7"><x:c r="A7" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Communication + fiber physical cables</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B7" s="308" t="n"><x:f>SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Communication")+SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Fiber Optic")</x:f><x:v>2</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C7" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Communication/fiber remain separately compatibility-gated.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Project / NEC compatibility</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F7" s="308" t="str" /></x:row><x:row r="8"><x:c r="A8" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Total non-power cable area</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B8" s="308" t="n"><x:f>SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AK$5:$AK$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"&lt;&gt;Power")</x:f><x:v>4.07825850325759</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C8" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Used to decide whether the verified 6-in ventilated channel fill limit can contain the non-power population.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>NEC 392.22 channel table</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>No arbitrary cable-count threshold is used; actual cable area is used.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="9"><x:c r="A9" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Single-conductor power physical cables</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B9" s="308" t="n"><x:f>SUMIFS('CABLE_ENGINE'!$AI$5:$AI$44,'CABLE_ENGINE'!$A$5:$A$44,"Yes",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$C$5:$C$44,"Power",'CABLE_ENGINE'!$P$5:$P$44,"Single Conductor")</x:f><x:v>9</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C9" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Drives phase-grouping, rung and cleat logic.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>CMP / NEC / Eaton</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Cleat engine applies later.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="10"><x:c r="A10" s="307" t="str"><x:v>EMI / RFI shielding requested?</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B10" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'INPUTS'!$B$23</x:f><x:v>No</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C10" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"INFO"</x:f><x:v>INFO</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>If requested, solid-bottom/cover shielding becomes the dominant tray-type requirement.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Solid bottom can retain moisture; select it for an actual protection/shielding need.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="11"><x:c r="A11" s="307" t="str"><x:v>AUTO tray type</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B11" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(AND('INPUTS'!$I$19&lt;&gt;"",'INPUTS'!$I$19&lt;&gt;"Auto"),'INPUTS'!$I$19,IF(B4=0,"INPUT REQUIRED",IF(B10="Yes","Solid Bottom",IF(B5&gt;0,"Ladder",IF(B8&lt;=3.8,"Ventilated Channel","Ladder")))))</x:f><x:v>Solid Bottom</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C11" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(OR(B11="Ladder",B11="Ventilated Channel",B11="Solid Bottom"),"PASS","INPUT REQUIRED")</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Power -&gt; Ladder; EMI/RFI -&gt; Solid Bottom; non-power-only area &lt;=3.8 in² -&gt; Ventilated Channel; otherwise Ladder.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Calculator decision, not a user dropdown.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="12"><x:c r="A12" s="307" t="str"><x:v>AUTO rung spacing</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B12" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(B11="Ladder",IF(B5&gt;0,9,6),"N/A")</x:f><x:v>N/A</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C12" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(B12="N/A","N/A","PASS")</x:f><x:v>N/A</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Power ladder defaults to 9 in; non-power ladder to 6 in.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Bend-radius check later can require a larger spacing only when code/project permits.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="13"><x:c r="A13" s="307" t="str"><x:v>AUTO cover requirement</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B13" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(AND('INPUTS'!$B$22&lt;&gt;"",'INPUTS'!$B$22&lt;&gt;"Auto"),'INPUTS'!$B$22,IF(B10="Yes","Solid","None"))</x:f><x:v>Solid</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C13" s="308" t="str"><x:f>"PASS"</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Auto cover becomes Solid only for EMI/RFI; otherwise None.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Eaton B-Line design considerations</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Cover clamps/accessories are selected later.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="14"><x:c r="A14" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Tray-type release</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B14" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(B4=0,"INPUT REQUIRED",IF('CABLE_SUMMARY'!$B$12="FAIL","FAIL",IF('CABLE_SUMMARY'!$B$12="INPUT REQUIRED","INPUT REQUIRED","PASS")))</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C14" s="308" t="str"><x:f>B14</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Step 2 must release before Step 3.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Step 2 + Step 3</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F14" s="308" t="str" /></x:row></x:sheetData><x:mergeCells><x:mergeCell ref="A1:F1" /></x:mergeCells><x:pageMargins left="0.7" right="0.7" top="0.75" bottom="0.75" header="0.3" footer="0.3" /></x:worksheet>